WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.398 --> 00:00:04.198
Unit one. Healthy Relationships and Consent!

2
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:10.104
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.154 --> 00:00:13.336
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.386 --> 00:00:18.863
Today we learn about Healthy Relationships and Consent. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:24.112
Consent. Say it with me. Consent!

6
00:00:27.581 --> 00:00:31.847
Mutual respect. Say it with me. Mutual respect!

7
00:00:35.353 --> 00:00:39.586
Communication. Say it with me. Communication!

8
00:00:43.094 --> 00:00:47.444
Healthy boundary. Say it with me. Healthy boundary!

9
00:00:50.951 --> 00:00:54.634
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

10
00:00:58.145 --> 00:01:02.212
Equality. Say it with me. Equality!

11
00:01:05.684 --> 00:01:09.317
Comfort. Say it with me. Comfort!

12
00:01:12.841 --> 00:01:17.175
Assertiveness. Say it with me. Assertiveness!

13
00:01:20.651 --> 00:01:35.142
Consent means clear, mutual agreement based on respect and open communication. A healthy relationship includes a healthy boundary, trust, and equality between people. Feeling comfortable to be assertive matters in any relationship.

14
00:01:35.192 --> 00:01:38.304
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:39.273 --> 00:01:44.618
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:44.668 --> 00:01:46.045
Communication!

17
00:01:47.048 --> 00:01:52.373
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.423 --> 00:01:53.573
Comfort!

19
00:01:54.473 --> 00:02:02.452
Did you know? Healthy relationship education has been shown to help teens build stronger, more respectful friendships overall.

20
00:02:02.502 --> 00:02:04.689
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:05.861 --> 00:02:15.210
Think and answer. Why is clear communication important in any relationship?

22
00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.410
Great answer!

23
00:02:17.394 --> 00:02:23.128
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
